{
"title": "Promotion"
}

ESUG is performing many promotion actions over the years. 

!! Mobility Support

ESUG supports student mobility for those who want to be in contact with research labs doing Smalltalk. 
We propose 5 grants of 600 Euros per year to students that want to do internships in labs doing Smalltalk. 
*more...>mobility.pillar*

!! Support your project

ESUG supports your projects. It can be projects related to software development, teaching, lectures, 
conference presence, etc. *more...>project.pillar*

!! Article Promotion
ESUG offers 100 Euros for each paper that gets published on 
Smalltalk (Any Smalltalk, Squeak, Pharo, Tweak, Croquet, Seaside....). *more...>article.pillar*

!! Publication Promotion

ESUG offers 150 Euros for each research paper that gets published on Smalltalk (Squeak, Dialects, Tweak, Croquet, Seaside....). *more...>publications.pillar*

